proposals.player_experience:
In explore the town acts out the engine's fixed meetings at the same clock times:
- 16:30 阿德 carries bread to 美咲's café;
- 17:00 老周 and 志明 walk the stage together;
- 17:30 小雯 corners the mayor;
- 18:00 美玲 brings flowers to the stage;
- 18:30 阿珠 marches to the town hall.
Friends visit each other: 阿德 and 美玲 chat across the street, and 老周 fetches his daily coffee from 美咲. From 18:30 a lamplighter lights the plaza poles with kids trailing, and 美咲's daughter rehearses at the stage. Players learn who meets whom and when, and can plan (「16:30 前先告訴阿德」).
